  - id: EV_CHEAP_CLOSED
    headline: CheapCart closes for restocking
    summary: CheapCart is closed today. Pantry food is unaffected.
    details: CheapCart is closed for a full restock today. You can still cook with
      what is in your pantry, or shop at another open store. CheapCart reopens tomorrow.
